            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Öznitelikler ne işe yarar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Etiketlere ek bilgiler eklerler</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Öznitelikler oyun döngüleri oluşturur</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Düşmanlar oluştururlar</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Öznitelikler seviyeler oluşturur</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Etiketlere ek bilgiler eklerler.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 144780,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bağlantı tarayıcıda nasıl görünür?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game Wiki\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Video_game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Video game\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">  Vurgulu bir bağlantı olarak <code>Video game</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Video game</code> normal bir bağlantı olarak</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">  Vurgulu ancak bozuk bağlantıya sahip <code>Video game</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Bağlantı olarak <code>&lt;em&gt;Video game&lt;/em&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">  Vurgulu bir bağlantı olarak <code>Video game</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
